# The shipped ConPTY is an .exe too (ADR-82); the rule above is there for
# build output, not for the console Windows Terminal gives us. ADR-83 moved it
# into a conpty subdirectory, and the exception has to name that: a pattern
# without it left the file out of the commit, which is what debbc6a fixed once
# for the flat layout.
!/resources/windows-*/conpty/OpenConsole.exe
